<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίνοια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thoughtfulness, quick
				comprehension</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				370c
			</span></i> : abs., <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				2.4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Zeux.</u>
				2
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν περινοίᾳ γεγονέναι</span>
			to have <i>comprehended</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).331
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>deliberation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν περινοίᾳ τοῦ μεταστήσοντος αὑτὸν
					ἦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					18.6.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>over-wiseness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.43
			</span></i> ; <i>subtlety</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογικὴ
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				1205.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>disdain, contempt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				1.141
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				12.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>sharp practice, fraud</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἀπάτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Just.
					<u>Nov.</u>
					7.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				1.3.41.5
			</span></i>.</div>
